        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVDsZWHb-i8_13lX9WqD3TO9z-PRhJUTvw31ufz_V0Mfw3Zx3u7=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "I had to get my front driver tint redone. He removed my old tint and installed the new tint in under 15 minutes!! (11 to be exact).\n\nAmazing service, he uses quality film and his prices are unbeatable. He offers a warranty on it at no extra cost.\n\nAutoart films wanted $150 for this job and Mar-Tint did it for $70.\n\nThanks again and I'll definitely bring more cars your way!",
        "time": 1758725220,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "J K",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114357781397191567588/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW0xAIVkBhGGc08MfQvfWWc3skE9_9_ozbMQbDFwd5txTFbMVpm5w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "If you are looking to get your windows tinted for your vehicle, they are the best!\nHighly recommend Martin.\nVery professional and really cares about his clients.",
        "time": 1684290597,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Wills",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105619994473236676210/reviews",
