        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Had my car done a couple of years ago and good job, I tried to book again a few different times for 3 cars but he consistently doesn’t reply to emails or phone. I didn’t have the time to keep trying so I booked elsewhere in Vaudreuil which ended up also being cheaper.",
        "time": 1714086077,
        "translated": false
      },
